{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136640/extras/9389f9f0ce39a770037e4e6ebbc59320.webp?t=1762353211\" width=32 height=40 /></span>Mimic Meadows is an extended version of Mimic Classic<strong>. </strong>If you enjoyed the original game, please <strong>wishlist</strong> above to find out when the new game comes out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All the assets shown above are from the original game. They will be updated soon!\u00a0 </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136640/extras/28af82405541ec2c45fc5ffa2153e5af.webp?t=1762353211\" width=40 height=40 /></span>Mimic Classic got great reviews, including praise from the creators of Baba Is You and VVVVVV. This has encouraged me to create a new version that explores the mechanic much more deeply. It has a bunch of new worlds, packed with puzzles that explore themes such as eating and mating. It also includes updated visuals &amp; audio, QoL features like level select and undo, optional extra-challenging levels, secrets and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I really like it when a game takes a weird idea and lets me discover all the funny unexpected consequences of it. 'What happens when I \u2026?' is one of the best questions a game can invite you to ask.&quot;\u00a0</i>  <br><i>-\u00a0</i>Terry Cavanagh\u2019s review of Mimic Classic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136640/extras/f447181500f05ac95e17e58f721aaf31.webp?t=1762353211\" width=40 height=40 /></span>I'll be showing more of the new game soon! Thanks for the support, Sourencho  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136640?t=1762353211","background_raw"