akes a weird idea and lets me discover all the funny unexpected consequences of it. 'What happens when I \u2026?' is one of the best questions a game can invite you to ask.&quot;\u00a0</i>  <br><i>-\u00a0</i>Terry Cavanagh\u2019s review of Mimic Classic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136640/extras/f447181500f05ac95e17e58f721aaf31.webp?t=1762353211\" width=40 height=40 /></span>I'll be showing more of the new game soon! Thanks for the support, Sourencho  </p>","developers":["sourencho"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136640/f287101a01e48b76d53d771fdb58183c7d52f760/header.jpg?t=1762353211","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  macOS Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4136640/1425607607/52a162cb087b6f042e19e92f8f9fa12358f39e0d/1761706204/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762352200","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4136640/1425607607/52a162cb087b6f042e19e92f8f9fa12358f39e0d/1761706204/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762352200","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4136640/1425607607/52a162cb087b6f042e19e92f8f9fa12358f39e0d/1761706204/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762352200","id":257223782,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223782/movie480.mp4?t=1762352200","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223782/movie_max.mp4?t=1762352200"},"name":"Mimic Classic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2